ust three buildings. History Our Mission Leadership and Administrative Offices Facts & Statistics Accreditation Community Partnerships Visit McNeese Campus Campus Maps Virtual Campus Tour Apply McNEESE STATE UNIVERSITY Faculty & Staff Resources Home - Faculty & Staff Resources Our Vision We believe that we change lives at McNeese. Our dedicated faculty and staff are committed to providing students with quality instruction and mentorship and promoting a student-centric learning environment. Our distinguished faculty ensure our academic programs prepare students with relevant knowledge and skills for success in their chosen careers and future educational endeavors. Because our campus is in the heart of Lake Charles and southwest Louisiana, we collaborate with local, regional, and global businesses and organizations. These relationships lead to internships, scholarships, and employment for our students, who then contribute to the economic and cultural growth of the region. Our graduates continue this legacy around the world as effective and responsible leaders. Faculty Resources Advising Handbook Institutional Research & Effectiveness Office of Research and Sponsored Programs Academic Calendar University Policies Marketing and Communications Shared Governance Faculty Senate Staff Senate Student Government Association General Resources Campus Map Dining Services Calcasieu Teachers and Employees Credit Union Academic Catalog Assessment Reports Facility Reservations/Rentals Faculty & Staff Search Human Resources Employment Opportunities Student Employment Graduate School and Grants Doré School of Graduate Studies Office of Research and Sponsored Programs Human Subjects Research Technology Resources IT Helpdesk MyMcNeese Portal Canvas Outlook 365 Email Banner Self-Service Campus Safety University Status & Emergency Preparedness Campus Police Tech Resources for Emergencies Academics Honors College Freshman Advising Academic Schedule Colleges & Departments Undergraduate Prog